#: docs/gesture-protocol.rst:2
msgid "Trackpad gesture protocol"
msgstr "触控板手势协议"

#: docs/gesture-protocol.rst:6
msgid ""
"A trackpad delivers more than scrolling: the system recognizes a pinch, a rotation, a swipe with "
"several fingers, a double tap with two fingers and fingers held still, and hands them to the "
"application as gestures. The trackpad gesture protocol is an open terminal extension that reports"
" them to the program running in the terminal. Like the other extensions here it is small, "
"unobtrusive, easy to implement and changes nothing about what the TTY is."
msgstr ""
"触控板不仅能滚动：系统还会识别捏合、旋转、多指轻扫、双指双击和手指静止按住，并将它们作为手势交给应用。触控板手势协议是将这些信息交给终端内程序的开放扩展。与其他扩展一样，它小巧、低干扰、易于实现，不改变"
" TTY 的本质。"

#: docs/gesture-protocol.rst:13
msgid ""
"It is independent of the :doc:`tablet-protocol`, which reports the fingers themselves and leaves "
"recognizing a gesture to the program. Both can be on at the same time, a program takes whichever "
"suits it."
msgstr "本协议独立于 :doc:`tablet-protocol`，后者直接报告手指接触，由程序自行识别手势。两者可同时启用，程序可按需选择。"

#: docs/gesture-protocol.rst:18
msgid "Framing"
msgstr "消息封装"

#: docs/gesture-protocol.rst:20
msgid "Frames are ``OSC 777`` with the ``gesture`` selector::"
msgstr "帧使用带有 ``gesture`` 选择器的 ``OSC 777``：::"

#: docs/gesture-protocol.rst:24
msgid ""
"They follow the rules every OSC 777 extension shares, which :doc:`extension-framing` gives: the "
"syntax of the fields, which frames are rejected, the units and the clock. ``v``, the protocol "
"version, is currently ``1``, and ``op`` is one of ``query``, ``cap``, ``mode`` and ``event``."
msgstr ""
"帧遵循 :doc:`extension-framing` 规定的 OSC 777 共用规则：字段语法、拒绝哪些帧、单位和时钟。协议版本 ``v`` 当前为 ``1``，``op`` 为 "
"``query``、``cap``、``mode`` 或 ``event``。"

#: docs/gesture-protocol.rst:30
msgid "Discovery"
msgstr "能力探测"

#: docs/gesture-protocol.rst:32
msgid "A program asks the terminal whether it supports the protocol::"
msgstr "程序询问终端是否支持本协议：::"

#: docs/gesture-protocol.rst:36
msgid ""
"``id`` is a non-negative 31 bit integer of the program's choosing, echoed in the reply so replies"
" can be matched to queries. A supporting terminal answers::"
msgstr "``id`` 是程序自行选择的非负 31 位整数，回复原样返回，以便匹配查询。支持协议的终端回答：::"

#: docs/gesture-protocol.rst:42
msgid ""
"``caps`` is a bit set of the gestures the terminal can report: pinch ``1``, rotate ``2``, swipe "
"``4``, smart zoom ``8``, hold ``16``. It describes what the terminal can pass on from the window "
"system it is connected to, not whether a trackpad is attached. ``mode`` is the current state of "
"the mode described below. A terminal that does not support the protocol ignores the query, so a "
"program must time out. A query does not change the mode."
msgstr ""
"``caps`` 是可报告手势的位集合：捏合 ``1``、旋转 ``2``、轻扫 ``4``、智能缩放 ``8``、按住 "
"``16``。它描述终端能从当前窗口系统转发什么，而非是否已连接触控板。``mode`` 为下述模式的当前状态。不支持本协议的终端会忽略查询，因此程序必须设置超时。查询不改变模式。"

#: docs/gesture-protocol.rst:51
msgid "Mode"
msgstr "模式"

#: docs/gesture-protocol.rst:53
msgid "Reports are off by default and turned on per terminal window with::"
msgstr "报告默认关闭，按终端窗口开启：::"

#: docs/gesture-protocol.rst:57
msgid ""
"``mode`` is a bit set of the kinds of gesture the program wants: ``1`` the gestures made by "
"moving fingers, which are the pinch, the rotation, the swipe and the smart zoom, ``2`` holds; "
"``0`` turns reporting off. While a bit is on, the gestures it names are reported with this "
"protocol when they happen over the window. A terminal drops the bits it does not know, so a "
"program that depends on a bit reads the mode back. The scroll and touch events the same fingers "
"produce are unaffected, a two finger pinch still scrolls if the system scrolls during it, so a "
"program that zooms on pinch should expect scroll reports too and ignore them while a pinch is in "
"progress."
msgstr ""
"``mode`` 是程序请求的手势种类位集合：``1`` 表示移动手指形成的捏合、旋转、轻扫和智能缩放，``2`` 表示按住；``0`` "
"关闭报告。相应位开启后，窗口上发生的对应手势由本协议报告。终端会舍弃不认识的位，因此依赖某个位的程序应读回状态。同一手指产生的滚动和触摸事件不受影响；系统在双指捏合期间产生滚动时仍会滚动，因此通过捏合缩放的程序也应预期滚动报告，并在捏合期间忽略它们。"

#: docs/gesture-protocol.rst:67
msgid ""
"The mode is local to the window, is reset by ``RIS``, and changing it cancels every gesture in "
"progress. Programs must turn it off when they exit, suspend or fail, and turn it back on when "
"resumed. Multiplexers keep it with the rest of the terminal state, restore it on reconnect, and "
"turn it off when detaching. A terminal may let its user refuse the mode, or some of its bits, for"
" every program or for some. A refused bit reads back as off and the gestures it names are not "
"reported, so a program reads the mode back rather than assume it was granted."
msgstr ""
"模式仅作用于当前窗口，由 ``RIS`` "
"重置，修改模式会取消全部进行中的手势。程序必须在退出、挂起或失败时关闭，恢复时重新开启。多路复用器与其他终端状态一起保存它，重连时恢复，脱离连接时关闭。终端可允许用户针对全部或部分程序拒绝模式或部分位；被拒绝的位读回为关闭，不报告相应手势，因此程序应读回状态，不要假定已获准。"

#: docs/gesture-protocol.rst:76
msgid ""
"A ``mode`` request without a ``mode`` field reads the state instead of changing it, and is "
"answered with::"
msgstr "不带 ``mode`` 字段的 ``mode`` 请求读取状态而不修改，回复为：::"

#: docs/gesture-protocol.rst:81
msgid ""
"A program resuming after a reconnection reads the mode to learn whether it survived, rather than "
"assuming it did."
msgstr "程序重连后恢复时，应读回模式，确认是否仍然有效，而非假定状态保留。"

#: docs/gesture-protocol.rst:85
msgid "Reports"
msgstr "报告"

#: docs/gesture-protocol.rst:87
msgid "A report is a single frame per event::"
msgstr "每个事件对应一帧报告：::"

#: docs/gesture-protocol.rst:91
msgid "``kind``, ``phase``, ``t``, ``x``, ``y`` and ``mods`` are always present:"
msgstr "始终包含 ``kind``、``phase``、``t``、``x``、``y`` 和 ``mods``："

#: docs/gesture-protocol.rst:94
msgid "``kind``"
msgstr "``kind``"

#: docs/gesture-protocol.rst:94
msgid "``1`` pinch, ``2`` rotate, ``3`` swipe, ``4`` smart zoom, ``5`` hold"
msgstr "``1`` 捏合，``2`` 旋转，``3`` 轻扫，``4`` 智能缩放，``5`` 按住"

#: docs/gesture-protocol.rst:96
msgid "``phase``"
msgstr "``phase``"

#: docs/gesture-protocol.rst:96
msgid "``1`` begin, ``2`` update, ``3`` end, ``4`` cancel"
msgstr "``1`` 开始，``2`` 更新，``3`` 结束，``4`` 取消"

#: docs/gesture-protocol.rst:97
msgid "``t``"
msgstr "``t``"

#: docs/gesture-protocol.rst:97
msgid ""
"When the system says the event happened, in milliseconds on the clock the terminal uses for every"
" extension, see :doc:`extension-framing`. A cancel the terminal makes itself has the time it made"
" it"
msgstr "系统认定事件发生的时刻，以终端全部扩展共用时钟的毫秒表示，见 :doc:`extension-framing`。终端自行生成的取消事件使用其生成时刻"

#: docs/gesture-protocol.rst:101
msgid "``tu``"
msgstr "``tu``"

#: docs/gesture-protocol.rst:101
msgid ""
"Microseconds past ``t``, ``0`` to ``999``, present only when the system stamps events more finely"
" than a millisecond"
msgstr "``t`` 之后的微秒数，范围 ``0`` 至 ``999``；仅在系统时间戳精度高于毫秒时出现"

#: docs/gesture-protocol.rst:103
msgid "``x``, ``y``"
msgstr "``x``、``y``"

#: docs/gesture-protocol.rst:103
msgid ""
"Position of the pointer in 1/256 of a physical pixel, signed, zero based, relative to the top "
"left of the cell area, within ±1073741823. A physical pixel is one of the framebuffer the "
"terminal draws into, not a scaled unit of the window system"
msgstr "指针位置，以物理像素的 1/256 为单位，有符号、从零开始，相对于字符单元区域左上角，范围为 ±1073741823。物理像素指终端帧缓冲区的像素，而非窗口系统缩放后的逻辑单位"

#: docs/gesture-protocol.rst:107
msgid "``mods``"
msgstr "``mods``"

#: docs/gesture-protocol.rst:107
msgid "Shift ``1``, Alt ``2``, Control ``4``, Super ``8``"
msgstr "Shift ``1``，Alt ``2``，Control ``4``，Super ``8``"

#: docs/gesture-protocol.rst:110
msgid "The fields a kind adds:"
msgstr "各手势新增的字段："

#: docs/gesture-protocol.rst:113
msgid "pinch ``scale``"
msgstr "捏合 ``scale``"

#: docs/gesture-protocol.rst:113
msgid ""
"The change in magnification since the previous report of the gesture, in thousandths: ``100`` is "
"ten percent larger, ``-100`` ten percent smaller"
msgstr "自上次报告以来的缩放变化，单位千分之一：``100`` 表示放大百分之十，``-100`` 表示缩小百分之十"

#: docs/gesture-protocol.rst:116
msgid "pinch ``total``"
msgstr "捏合 ``total``"

#: docs/gesture-protocol.rst:116
msgid "The magnification since the gesture began, in thousandths, ``1000`` when unchanged"
msgstr "自手势开始以来的总缩放比例，单位千分之一，不变时为 ``1000``"

#: docs/gesture-protocol.rst:118
msgid "rotate ``angle``"
msgstr "旋转 ``angle``"

#: docs/gesture-protocol.rst:118
msgid "The rotation since the previous report, in hundredths of a degree, clockwise positive"
msgstr "自上次报告以来的旋转量，单位百分之一度，顺时针为正"

#: docs/gesture-protocol.rst:120
msgid "rotate ``total``"
msgstr "旋转 ``total``"

#: docs/gesture-protocol.rst:120
msgid "The rotation since the gesture began, in hundredths of a degree"
msgstr "自手势开始以来的总旋转量，单位百分之一度"

#: docs/gesture-protocol.rst:122
msgid "swipe ``dx``, ``dy``"
msgstr "轻扫 ``dx``、``dy``"

#: docs/gesture-protocol.rst:122
msgid ""
"The direction the fingers moved, ``-1``, ``0`` or ``1`` on each axis, positive to the right and "
"down. Exactly one of the two is non-zero"
msgstr "手指移动方向，各轴为 ``-1``、``0`` 或 ``1``，向右和向下为正。两个轴中恰有一个非零"

#: docs/gesture-protocol.rst:127
msgid "A smart zoom and a hold carry no extra fields."
msgstr "智能缩放和按住不携带额外字段。"

#: docs/gesture-protocol.rst:129
msgid ""
"Any kind may also carry ``fingers``, the number of fingers making the gesture. The system tells "
"it when the gesture begins, and it is then present in every report of that gesture. It is absent "
"when the system does not say."
msgstr "任意手势还可携带 ``fingers``，表示参与的手指数。系统在手势开始时提供该值，此后该手势的每条报告均包含它；系统未提供时省略。"

#: docs/gesture-protocol.rst:134
msgid "Lifecycle"
msgstr "生命周期"

#: docs/gesture-protocol.rst:136
msgid ""
"A gesture begins with ``begin``, is followed by any number of ``update`` reports and ends with "
"``end`` or ``cancel``. A ``begin`` carries a ``scale`` of ``0``, an ``angle`` of ``0``, and a "
"``total`` of ``1000`` or ``0``. A swipe and a smart zoom are instantaneous: they are reported as "
"a ``begin`` immediately followed by an ``end``, both with the same fields. A pinch and a rotation"
" are independent gestures that usually run at the same time, since two fingers that pinch also "
"turn a little, so a program interested in one must tolerate reports of the other."
msgstr ""
"手势以 ``begin`` 开始，接任意数量 ``update``，以 ``end`` 或 ``cancel`` 结束。``begin`` 中的 ``scale`` 为 "
"``0``，``angle`` 为 ``0``，``total`` 为 ``1000`` 或 ``0``。轻扫和智能缩放为瞬时手势：先报告 ``begin``，紧接字段相同的 "
"``end``。捏合与旋转相互独立，通常同时发生，因为捏合的双指也会略微旋转，因此关注其中一种的程序必须能处理另一种报告。"

#: docs/gesture-protocol.rst:145
msgid ""
"A hold begins when fingers come to rest on the trackpad and ends when they lift, with no "
"``update`` in between. It is cancelled when the fingers start to move instead, which usually "
"begins a scroll or another gesture. Programs use it to stop something in motion, a coasting "
"scroll, say, the moment the user touches the trackpad."
msgstr "手指在触控板上静止时开始按住，抬起时结束，中间没有 ``update``。手指开始移动时取消按住，通常继而开始滚动或其他手势。程序可用它在用户接触触控板的一刻停止运动，例如停止惯性滚动。"

#: docs/gesture-protocol.rst:151
msgid ""
"A gesture is captured by the window it began in, and its later reports go to that window even "
"when the pointer moves out of it, so coordinates can be negative or exceed the cell area. The "
"terminal cancels gestures in progress when the mode changes or the terminal is reset. After a "
"cancel the rest of that gesture is not reported, not even its ``end``. Programs must tolerate a "
"repeated cancel and a fresh ``begin`` for a kind they still have open, which replaces the earlier"
" gesture."
msgstr ""
"手势由其开始时所在的窗口捕获，即使指针移出，该手势后续报告仍发给原窗口，因此坐标可为负数或超过字符单元区域。模式变化或终端重置时，终端取消进行中的手势。取消后不再报告该手势的任何后续事件，包括 "
"``end``。程序必须容忍重复取消，以及对仍处于活动状态的同种手势收到新 ``begin``，后者替代旧手势。"

#: docs/gesture-protocol.rst:159
msgid ""
"A terminal or a relay that cannot keep up with the program may merge consecutive ``update`` "
"reports of one gesture into one, and nothing else: a merged pinch has the product of the changes "
"in magnification as its ``scale``, a merged rotation the sum of the angles as its ``angle``, and "
"both have the ``total``, ``t`` and ``tu`` of the last report merged. A ``begin``, an ``end`` and "
"a ``cancel`` are never merged or dropped, see :doc:`extension-framing`."
msgstr ""
"无法跟上程序处理速度的终端或中继，只能将同一手势的连续 ``update`` 合并：捏合报告的 ``scale`` 为缩放变化的乘积，旋转报告的 ``angle`` 为角度之和，两者的 "
"``total``、``t`` 和 ``tu`` 都取最后一条报告。``begin``、``end`` 和 ``cancel`` 绝不合并或丢弃，见 :doc:`extension-"
"framing`。"

#: docs/gesture-protocol.rst:167
msgid ""
"A multiplexer translates ``x,y`` by the pane's origin (borders included), forwards every other "
"field unchanged, delivers each gesture only to the pane it began in, and cancels gestures when "
"panes move or resize."
msgstr "多路复用器按窗格原点（含边框）转换 ``x,y``，其他字段原样转发；每个手势仅交给其开始时所在窗格。窗格移动或调整大小时取消手势。"

#: docs/gesture-protocol.rst:172
msgid "Versions and extension"
msgstr "版本与扩展"

#: docs/gesture-protocol.rst:174
msgid ""
"A program ignores a frame whose ``op`` it does not know, a report whose ``kind`` it does not know"
" and fields it does not know, so all three are added without a version change. A new kind is also"
" only sent to a program that asked for it with a mode bit of its own, as the hold is, so a "
"program that sends ``mode=1`` sees the four kinds that bit names and nothing else, however much "
"the protocol grows. A new ``phase`` value, or a change in the meaning of an existing field, needs"
" a new version."
msgstr ""
"程序忽略不认识 ``op`` 的帧、不认识 ``kind`` "
"的报告和不认识的字段，因此三者新增内容均不必升级版本。新手势种类也只发送给通过其独立模式位请求它的程序，按住即如此；所以无论协议如何增长，发送 ``mode=1`` "
"的程序只看到该位定义的四种手势。新增 ``phase`` 值或改变既有字段含义时，需要新版本。"

#: docs/gesture-protocol.rst:183
msgid "Implementations"
msgstr "实现情况"

#: docs/gesture-protocol.rst:185
msgid ""
"silkie, this fork of kitty: pinch, rotate, swipe and smart zoom on macOS; pinch, rotate, swipe "
"and hold, with the number of fingers, on Wayland; pinch, rotate and swipe, with the number of "
"fingers, on X11. ``kitty --debug-input`` logs the gestures it sees."
msgstr ""
"silkie（此 kitty 分支）：macOS 支持捏合、旋转、轻扫和智能缩放；Wayland 支持捏合、旋转、轻扫和按住，并报告手指数；X11 "
"支持捏合、旋转和轻扫，并报告手指数。``kitty --debug-input`` 记录所见手势。"

#: docs/gesture-protocol.rst:191
msgid "Implementation notes for silkie"
msgstr "silkie 实现说明"

#: docs/gesture-protocol.rst:193
msgid "silkie passes on what the window system recognizes:"
msgstr "silkie 转发窗口系统识别的手势："

#: docs/gesture-protocol.rst:195
msgid ""
"On macOS, the magnify, rotate, swipe and smart magnify events of AppKit. A swipe with three "
"fingers only reaches applications when System Settings has it set to swipe between pages, and a "
"smart zoom when the trackpad's smart zoom is enabled. AppKit does not say how many fingers made a"
" gesture, so ``fingers`` is absent. Its events are stamped to the microsecond, so ``tu`` is sent "
"on macOS only: Wayland and X11 stamp gestures in whole milliseconds."
msgstr ""
"macOS：使用 AppKit 的 magnify、rotate、swipe 和 smart magnify "
"事件。系统设置中将三指轻扫配置为页面间轻扫时，应用才能收到它；启用触控板智能缩放时才能收到智能缩放。AppKit 不提供手指数，因此省略 ``fingers``。事件时间戳精确到微秒，所以仅 "
"macOS 发送 ``tu``；Wayland 和 X11 手势时间戳为整毫秒。"

#: docs/gesture-protocol.rst:202
msgid ""
"On Wayland, through version 3 of ``pointer-gestures-unstable-v1``, and ``caps`` is zero on a "
"compositor without it. A pinch there carries both scale and rotation, so one compositor pinch is "
"reported as a pinch and a rotation. A swipe is reported once it ends, as its dominant direction, "
"and compositors keep most three finger swipes for themselves. A hold also stops kitty's own "
"coasting scroll."
msgstr ""
"Wayland：通过 ``pointer-gestures-unstable-v1`` 第 3 版提供；不支持的合成器上 ``caps`` "
"为零。一个捏合事件同时包含缩放与旋转，因此报告为一个捏合手势和一个旋转手势。轻扫结束后按主方向报告，合成器通常保留大多数三指轻扫供自己使用。按住也会停止 kitty 自身的惯性滚动。"

#: docs/gesture-protocol.rst:208
msgid ""
"On X11, through the touchpad gestures of XInput 2.4, which needs version 21.1 or later of the X "
"server and a driver that sends them, as the libinput driver does. ``caps`` is zero when the "
"server does not have them. A pinch and a swipe are reported as on Wayland. X11 has no hold and no"
" smart zoom."
msgstr ""
"X11：通过 XInput 2.4 的触控板手势提供，需要 X 服务器 21.1 或更新版本，以及会发送这些事件的驱动（如 libinput 驱动）。服务器不支持时 ``caps`` "
"为零。捏合和轻扫的报告方式与 Wayland 相同。X11 不提供按住或智能缩放。"

